/figure><p>【本文獲《觀察者網》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T01:42:40.983931+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2029,"images":24,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}